ReGainDrop research code, development snapshot prepared 2026-11-02.

This distribution contains adaptations of VisPruner (Theia-4869/VisPruner),
LLaVA (haotian-liu/LLaVA), and Hugging Face Transformers/Qwen2.5-VL.
Original copyright and attribution notices in source files are retained.
Apache-2.0 license text is provided in LICENSE.

The author-provided snapshot contains changes to the visual scoring and pruning
logic. Release preparation changes package metadata, documentation and launch
paths; it does not alter that snapshot's model computations. Development status
and known paper/code discrepancies are documented in docs/REPRODUCIBILITY.md.

llava/eval/m4c_evaluator.py contains code copied from Facebook Research MMF;
its BSD license is provided in third_party_licenses/MMF_BSD_LICENSE.txt.
